\item[S2] Hong Duc Bui, Square Packing with Asymptotically Smallest Waste Only Needs Good Squares (2025). Section 2, Definitions 2, 4 and 5, pp. 1–2. \url{https://arxiv.org/pdf/2504.09489}.
